• 仅在设备解锁且您明确同意后进行数据采集";fast_mode,30,V4002e08ae,2f002e08d9,;"Fast Mode";fast_mode,31,V4002e0733,2a002e0759,;"快速模式";success_settings_saved,30,V400711b4e,4100711b8b,;"Settings saved";success_settings_saved,31,V4007113e2,3800711416,;"设置已保存";data_visualization,30,V4003509eb,4100350a28,;"Data Visualization";data_visualization,31,V40035083b,340035086b,;"数据可视化";latency,30,V400f93f33,2b00f93f5a,;"Latency";latency,31,V400f92d14,2600f92d36,;"延迟";grpc_status,30,V400fa3f5f,3300fa3f8e,;"gRPC Status";grpc_status,31,V400fa2d3b,2e00fa2d65,;"gRPC状态";revoke_consent_message,30,V4014c5196,97014c5229,;"Are you sure you want to revoke consent and delete all collected data? This action cannot be undone.";revoke_consent_message,31,V4014c3ccf,50014c3d1b,;"您确定要撤回同意并删除所有已采集的数据吗？此操作无法撤销。";retry_policy,30,V40107423d,350107426e,;"Retry Policy";retry_policy,31,V401072fb5,2d01072fde,;"重试策略";discarded_count,30,V401004099,35010040ca,;"Discarded";discarded_count,31,V401002e50,2f01002e7b,;"已丢弃";z_axis,30,V4003d0b9a,24003d0bba,;"Z";z_axis,31,V4003d09b2,25003d09d3,;"Z轴";device_id_copied,30,V400dc3891,4a00dc38d7,;"Device ID copied to clipboard";device_id_copied,31,V400dc27ae,3800dc27e2,;"设备ID已复制到剪贴板";accelerometer,30,V400130374,37001303a7,;"Accelerometer";accelerometer,31,V4001302bf,2e001302e9,;"加速度计";dialog_ok,30,V400761c0e,2800761c32,;"OK";dialog_ok,31,V40076148c,28007614b0,;"确定";success_collection_started,30,V4006e1a63,4e006e1aad,;"Data collection started";success_collection_started,31,V4006e132b,3e006e1365,;"数据采集已开始";cpu_usage_format,30,V401214833,3301214862,;"%.1f%%";cpu_usage_format,31,V4012134d4,3301213503,;"%.1f%%";uptime_minutes_format,30,V4012348b1,3c012348e9,;"%d minutes";uptime_minutes_format,31,V401233554,3701233587,;"%d 分钟";privacy_agreement_content,30,V4004e0ec5,417004e12d8,;"This application collects sensor data (accelerometer\, gyroscope\, magnetometer) and usage statistics for continuous authentication research purposes.

• Data Collection\: Motion sensor data is collected only when the device is unlocked and the app is active.

• Data Processing\: All data is encrypted immediately using AES-256-GCM encryption before temporary storage.

• Data Storage\: Encrypted data is temporarily cached in the app's private directory and deleted after successful upload.

• Data Transmission\: Data is transmitted securely using TLS 1.3 encryption to research servers.

• Data Usage\: Collected data is used solely for academic research on continuous authentication systems.

• Data Sharing\: Data is not shared with third parties and is used only for specified research purposes.

• User Rights\: You can revoke consent and delete all collected data at any time by uninstalling the application.

By continuing\, you consent to this data collection and processing.";privacy_agreement_content,31,V4004e0c54,17d004e0dcd,;"本应用为持续身份认证研究目的采集传感器数据（加速度计、陀螺仪、磁力计）和使用统计。\\n\\n• 数据采集：仅在设备解锁且应用激活时采集运动传感器数据。\\n\\n• 数据处理：所有数据采用AES-256-GCM加密技术在临时存储前立即加密。\\n\\n• 数据存储：加密数据临时缓存在应用私有目录中，成功上传后删除。\\n\\n• 数据传输：数据通过TLS 1.3加密安全传输至研究服务器。\\n\\n• 数据用途：采集的数据仅用于持续身份认证系统的学术研究。\\n\\n• 数据共享：数据不与第三方共享，仅用于指定研究目的。\\n\\n• 用户权利：您可以随时撤回同意并通过卸载应用删除所有采集数据。\\n\\n继续使用即表示您同意此数据采集和处理。";batch_size,30,V40106420b,3101064238,;"Batch Size";batch_size,31,V401062f88,2c01062fb0,;"批处理大小";idle,30,V400f03d86,2500f03da7,;"Idle";idle,31,V400f02bb4,2300f02bd3,;"空闲";time_hours_ago,30,V4009b21e7,37009b221a,;"%d hours ago";time_hours_ago,31,V4009b19bc,31009b19e9,;"%d 小时前";encrypted_data_upload,30,V401374d04,4701374d47,;"Encrypted Data Upload";encrypted_data_upload,31,V4013738e6,380137391a,;"加密数据上传";grant_permission,30,V4005e16ef,3d005e1728,;"Grant Permission";grant_permission,31,V4005e107a,31005e10a7,;"授予权限";success_collection_stopped,30,V4006f1ab2,4e006f1afc,;"Data collection stopped";success_collection_stopped,31,V4006f136a,3e006f13a4,;"数据采集已停止";sensor_info_format,30,V401174592,58011745e6,;"Rate\: %.1f Hz\, FIFO\: %d";sensor_info_format,31,V40117325e,56011732b0,;"速率\: %.1f Hz\, FIFO\: %d";permission_required,30,V4005f172d,43005f176c,;"Permission Required";permission_required,31,V4005f10ac,34005f10dc,;"需要权限";uptime,30,V4010d438a,29010d43af,;"Uptime";uptime,31,V4010d30cb,27010d30ee,;"运行时间";buffer_stats,30,V400fc3fc7,3500fc3ff8,;"Buffer Stats";buffer_stats,31,V400fc2d98,2e00fc2dc2,;"缓冲区统计";upload_start_failed,30,V4012b4a90,4a012b4ad6,;"Failed to start upload\: %s";upload_start_failed,31,V4012b36bf,3a012b36f5,;"启动上传失败\: %s";dialog_no,30,V400781c62,2800781c86,;"No";dialog_no,31,V4007814de,2700781501,;"否";usage_stats_permission_title,30,V4005c15af,54005c15ff,;"Usage Statistics Permission";usage_stats_permission_title,31,V4005c0fca,3f005c1005,;"使用统计权限";server_ip_address,30,V400de3918,3f00de3953,;"Server IP Address";server_ip_